## Overview

Version {{version}} of the plan. The store is in [the other document](other.smd#EF-STORE), and this part is [the overview](#overview).
Retries are capped at five[^retries]. Every API call counts against the SLO.
The checkout requirement is :ref[EF-R1], and the work after it is :ref[EF-T2].

:::note{title="Read first"}
A callout the hover explains.
:::

```ts file="src/pricing.ts" lines="1-3"
```

## Requirements

:::requirement{#EF-R1 status=accepted} Checkout answers within 200 ms
It applies to every endpoint in [the overview](#overview).
:::

:::acceptance{#EF-A1 verifies=EF-R1} A load test passes at 200 ms
:::

:::decision{#EF-D1 status=accepted} Cache prices for ten minutes
:::

:::risk{#EF-K1 likelihood=medium impact=high} The cache may serve stale prices
:::

## Work

- [ ] Build the checkout {#EF-T1}
- [ ] Load test the checkout :depends[EF-T1] {#EF-T2}

:::glossary Glossary
- **API**: Application Programming Interface
- **SLO**: Service level objective
:::

[^retries]: Five covers almost every transient failure.
